  "label": "Winter Weather as a Burden",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references the real-world stereotype that winter weather, particularly snow, is a nuisance or burden for many people. This is a common cultural perception, especially in regions with cold climates, where snowfall can disrupt daily life, transportation, and property maintenance. The meme exaggerates this perception for comedic effect.",
